    "created_at": "2020-06-16T10:54:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-16T10:57:33Z",
    "body": "I had an issue with Starship not reporting when the exit code is non-0 (symbol and the default green > red colour change).\r\n\r\nTurned out that I had other prompt commands running before starship which overrides the `$?` Starship sees. (If they run after starship the duration module is wrong :( )\r\n\r\nHere is what I did to fix it: https://github.com/ZeePal/workstation-ubuntu/blob/master/roles/starship/tasks/main.yml#L128\r\n\r\nCan you give us the output of this command to assist `type PROMPT_COMMAND`?\r\nCan you also test after running this command `export PROMPT_COMMAND=starship_precmd`? (restart your shell/terminal to restore the default config)",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/starship/starship/issues/comments/644690560/reactions",
      "total_count": 2,
      "+1": 1,
