    "created_at": "2020-06-16T11:11:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-16T11:11:29Z",
    "body": "Indeed, it seems like the culprit is the modified `PROMPT_COMMAND` value:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\necho $PROMPT_COMMAND \r\nhistory -a;starship_precmd;\r\n```\r\n\r\nand when I run  `export PROMPT_COMMAND=starship_precmd`, it works as expected:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n🕙[13:10:42] via emre on ⟪emre-lubuntu-vm⟫ in ~ via 🐏 6% on ☁  us-east-1 \r\n➜ export PROMPT_COMMAND=starship_precmd\r\n\r\n🕙[13:10:47] via emre on ⟪emre-lubuntu-vm⟫ in ~ via 🐏 6% on ☁  us-east-1 \r\n➜ false\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              \r\n🕙[13:10:50] via emre on ⟪emre-lubuntu-vm⟫ in ~ via 🐏 6% on ☁  us-east-1                                                                                                                                                                                     \r\n✗    \r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
