    "body": "Maybe the [fix](https://github.com/wting/autojump#known-issues) (suggested for [autojump](https://github.com/wting/autojump)) [here](https://github.com/wting/autojump#known-issues) can help, e.g. appending the `history -a` to the `PROMPT_COMMAND` instead of directly overwriting it. I'll give it a try.",
