    "body": "It seems like `export PROMPT_COMMAND=\"${PROMPT_COMMAND:+$PROMPT_COMMAND ;} history -a\"` worked in my case. It might be _good to add a reminder/warning/pointer_ to [the documentation for Character](https://starship.rs/config/#character), similar to the style used in [documentation of Command duration](https://starship.rs/config/#command-duration).",
